！あなたの作品が大好きです。私のOCは、ドヤ顔で空気の読めない鬼です。あなたのクリエイティビティを存分に発揮してください！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mekERpGRwyohEO7e05oPOKO36y2Xnenz?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@huraihuraihurai/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e39d0cf1/uploads/origins/ae582dfa-77f3-431c-b4c6-f92345b74169?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c517bae8b118cc12086eab8305e7e7c4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e39d0cf1/uploads/origins/ae582dfa-77f3-431c-b4c6-f92345b74169?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c517bae8b118cc12086eab8305e7e7c4, https://si.imgix.net/e39d0cf1/uploads/origins/ae582dfa-77f3-431c-b4c6-f92345b74169?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=49963091e856ba8e62470b6a026ae207 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e39d0cf1/uploads/origins/ae582dfa-77f3-431c-b4c6-f92345b74169?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ebb6bed19c07688d453d1e390ac1b87 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！お返事ありがとうございます！\n蒼空を描いてくださりありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://x.com/soraplayss/status/1863815501748580856\n\nhttps://x.com/soraplayss/status/1881606963181867151", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@huraihuraihurai/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1a66f2ba/uploads/origins/3e86e75c-9e0a-4cb0-897f-37ebebbaf720?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59dbdd27a2d773b9af791c5641620e43", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1a66f2ba/uploads/origins/3e86e75c-9e0a-4cb0-897f-37ebebbaf720?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59dbdd27a2d773b9af791c5641620e43, https://si.imgix.net/1a66f2ba/uploads/origins/3e86e75c-9e0a-4cb0-897f-37ebebbaf720?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=af016b0065281fef1e8f51ffa3b00855 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1a66f2ba/uploads/origins/3e86e75c-